4",3.82],[-1,"Yes, it's me!","Taip, čia aš!",1],[0,"It really is you!","Tai tikrai tu!","901b7fe92119",2.14],[0,"Wow, you look great!","Oho, puikiai atrodai!","d782f1e2ea75",2.01],[-1,"You look great too!","Tu irgi puikiai atrodai!",1],[0,"Ha! I wish!","Cha! Kad taip būtų!","b245d0e005e1",1.66],[0,"So... how are you?","Tai kaip tau sekasi?","667a74c59900",1.98],[-1,"Busy, but good!","Daug darbų, bet gerai!",1],[0,"Aw, that's great!","Oi, puiku!","472a54b6021a",1.84],[0,"So, what have you been up to?","Tai ką veikei visą tą laiką?","01e1002f9c35",1.9],[-1,"And you?","O tu?",1],[0,"Well, I moved back home last spring. And guess what? I got married!","Na, praėjusį pavasarį grįžau namo. Ir įsivaizduok – ištekėjau!","f0f070cb6076",4.33],[-1,"What's new with you?","Kas naujo pas tave?",1],[0,"So, what's new with you?","Tai kas naujo pas tave?","d67ee84104b5",1.89],[-1,"I got married!","Vedžiau!",1],[0,"No way! Congratulations!","Negali būti! Sveikinu!","7bef9d2ed39f",3.18],[0,"Thanks! And... we have twins!","Ačiū! Ir... turime dvynukus!","a5a7844c3387",3.62],[-1,"I'm so happy for you!","Labai džiaugiuosi dėl tavęs!",1],[0,"Thank you! I'm so happy.","Ačiū! Aš tokia laiminga.","d555e01a3b37",2.28],[0,"Hey, do you remember Mike? From our class?","Ei, ar prisimeni Maiką iš mūsų klasės?","c1714f7a8bd5",2.64],[-1,"Sorry, I don't remember him.","Atsiprašau, neprisimenu jo.",1],[0,"Tall guy, always telling jokes?","Aukštas vaikinas, visada pasakodavo anekdotus?","74269bfee9cc",2.01],[-1,"Of course! How is he?","Žinoma! Kaip jam sekasi?",1],[0,"He has a restaurant in town now! Mike's Grill.","Dabar jis turi restoraną mieste – „Mike's Grill“!","580aaeba0737",3.49],[0,"Hey, why don't we all have dinner there on Friday?","Ei, gal visi penktadienį ten pavakarieniaujame?","20834c6f05f1",2.8],[-1,"Great idea!","Puiki mintis!",1],[0,"Great! I'll ask him.","Puiku! Paklausiu jo.","a7db6d963dcc",1.79],[0,"We should keep in touch! Can I get your number?","Turėtume palaikyti ryšį! Ar galiu gauti tavo numerį?","cd30b114d9bd",2.51],[-1,"Can I have your number?","Ar galiu gauti tavo numerį?",1],[0,"Of course! Give me your phone. There! Text me anytime.","Žinoma! Duok savo telefoną. Štai! Rašyk bet kada.","f0b84317e291",5.57],[0,"It was so good to see you!","Buvo taip gera tave matyti!","c7a895a2e8a0",2.28],[0,"No way! Is that really you?","Negali būti! Ar čia tikrai tu?","e8d93dc8cddf",3.21],[-1,"Hi! How are you?","Labas! Kaip sekasi?",1],[0,"I'm great! Really good, actually.","Puikiai! Tiesą sakant, tikrai gerai.","7025f841eac6",3.14],[0,"And you?","O tu?","58374ae6cbf4",0.86],[-1,"Pretty good, thanks!","Visai gerai, ačiū!",1],[0,"Oh, good! Glad to hear it.","O, gerai! Smagu girdėti.","15fbf55a00e8",1.78],[0,"You haven't changed a bit!","Tu visai nepasikeitei!","be61c1468df8",2.41],[0,"Ha! You're too kind.","Cha! Tu per malonus.","5d2b1d940b53",1.67],[-1,"I have a new job.","Turiu naują darbą.",1],[0,"Congratulations! That's great news!","Sveikinu! Puiki žinia!","19cbb1910da3",3.33],[-1,"Yes, I do!","Taip, prisimenu!",1],[0,"We should all go there together!","Turėtume visi kartu ten nueiti!","b5268f7cb93a",2.4],[0,"Hey, do you have time for a coffee?","Ei, gal turi laiko kavai?","b8cfd959ab99",1.71],[-1,"Sure, I'd love to!","Žinoma, mielai!",1],[0,"Great! Let's sit over here.","Puiku! Sėskime čia.","a8dc886c7dfb",1.78],[-1,"My number is five five five, oh one four two.","Mano numeris – 555-0142.",1],[0,"Got it! I'll text you so you have mine.","Užsirašiau! Parašysiu tau, kad turėtum mano numerį.","2f2c57dbc8d8",2.3],[0,"It was so great running into you!","Buvo taip smagu tave sutikti!","735193cb2a73",2.73],[0,"Oh my gosh, is that you?! Long time no see!","O Dieve, ar čia tu?! Seniai nesimatėme!","daac4c15d65c",3.28],[-1,"Thanks! You too!","Ačiū! Tu irgi!",1],[0,"So, how have you been?","Tai kaip gyvenai?","f1475fb33ac0",1.59],[-1,"How have you been?","Kaip gyvenai?",1],[-1,"Fine, thank you. And you?","Gerai, ačiū. O tau?",1],[-1,"I moved here last year!","Pernai atsikrausčiau čia!",1],[0,"No way! You live here now? That's amazing!","Negali būti! Dabar gyveni čia? Nuostabu!","996f29cf92da",4.39],[-1,"That's great news!","Puiki žinia!",1],[-1,"Congratulations!","Sveikinu!",1],[-1,"Sorry, I have to go.","Atsiprašau, turiu eiti.",1],[0,"No worries! Next time.","Nieko tokio! Kitą kartą.","7fabc616776d",1.7],[0,"Let's swap numbers!","Apsikeiskime numeriais!","fbb4a7800043",1.45],[-1,"Let's swap numbers!","Apsikeiskime numeriais!",1],[0,"Definitely! What's your number?","Būtinai! Koks tavo numeris?","54d2c7e02190",2],[-1,"Let's keep in touch!","Palaikykime ryšį!",1],[-1,"It's so good to see you!","Taip gera tave matyti!",1],[-1,"Neither have you!","Tu irgi nepasikeitei!",1],[-1,"I can't complain.","Negaliu skųstis.",1],[-1,"What about you?","O tu?",1],[0,"Oh, you know, same old!","O, žinai – viskas po senovei!","2c72dd8e7fd6",1.5],[-1,"Great, thanks for asking!","Puikiai, ačiū, kad klausi!",1],[-1,"I'm learning English.","Mokausi anglų kalbos.",1],[0,"Wow! Your English is really good!","Oho! Tu tikrai gerai kalbi angliškai!","659e22393727",3.2],[-1,"Lucy! Long time no see!","Lucy! Seniai nesimatėme!",1],[-1,"Not much, the usual.","Nieko ypatingo, kaip visada.",1],[0,"Ha, I know the feeling.","Cha, pažįstamas jausmas.","c857d12fe1e9",1.79],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[-1,"Maybe next time!","Gal kitą kartą!",1],[-1,"I'm good, thanks. And you?","Gerai, ačiū. O tau?",1]],"contexts":[{"visits":3,"seed":1},{"sim":3,"visits":0,"seed":4},{"visits":3,"seed":2},{"sim":0,"visits":0,"seed":1},{"sim":2,"visits":0,"seed":3},{"sim":1,"visits":0,"seed":2},{"visits":0,"seed":1},{"visits":2,"seed":1},{"visits":1,"seed":1},{"visits":1,"seed":2},{"visits":2,"seed":2},{"visits":0,"seed":2}],"replies":["greet/4","compliment/1","been/3","ask_back/0","news/6","news/3","react/2","mike/2","mike/0","plan_answer/0","touch/1","g_social/4","g_howareyou/2","news/1","mike/1","coffee_answer/0","touch/0","complime